## I. Project Title
EasyBudget: Simple Dailey Expense Tracker

## II. Problem Statement
Many students and young people struggle to keep track of their daily spending. They often do not know where their money goes, overspend on unnecessary things, and run out of money before the week ends. This affects their ability to save for important things and learn good money habits. It is a problem worth solving because learning to manage money early helps people become more responsible and financially stable in the future.

## III. Project Objectives
1. Create a simple tool that lets users record daily expenses and see a running total of their spending within 3 minutes of use.
2. Help users stay within their set budget by showing a clear warning when they are close to or over their limit.
3. Display a summary of total spending and remaining money at any time to help users make better spending decisions.

## IV. Planned Features
- Add and name expenses with an amount
- Set a daily or weekly budget limit
- View total money spent and remaining budget
- See a simple summary of all recorded expenses
- Get a message when nearing or exceeding the budget limit

## V. Planned Inputs and Outputs

*Inputs:*
- User enters expense name and amount
- User enters their budget amount
- User chooses to view summary or exit

*Outputs:*
- Saves expense and updates total spent
- Shows remaining budget
- Displays full expense list and summary
- Shows warning if budget is near or exceeded

## VI. Logic Plan — Pseudocode

```plaintext
START
  DISPLAY "Welcome to EasyBudget!"
  ASK user for their budget amount
  STORE budget
  SET total_spent = 0
  CREATE empty list for expenses

  REPEAT
    DISPLAY "--- MENU ---"
    DISPLAY "1. Add Expense"
    DISPLAY "2. View Summary"
    DISPLAY "3. Exit"
    ASK user to choose an option

    IF option = 1 THEN
      ASK for expense name
      ASK for expense amount
      ADD amount to total_spent
      ADD name and amount to expenses list
      CALCULATE remaining = budget - total_spent
      DISPLAY "Expense added successfully!"
      
      IF total_spent > budget THEN
        DISPLAY "WARNING: You have exceeded your budget!"
      ELSE IF total_spent > budget * 0.8 THEN
        DISPLAY "Note: You have used over 80% of your budget!"
      END IF

    ELSE IF option = 2 THEN
      DISPLAY "===== EXPENSE SUMMARY ====="
      DISPLAY "Total Budget: ", budget
      DISPLAY "Total Spent: ", total_spent
      DISPLAY "Remaining: ", budget - total_spent
      DISPLAY "--- List of Expenses ---"
      SHOW all expenses in the list
      DISPLAY "==========================="

    ELSE IF option = 3 THEN
      DISPLAY "Thank you for using EasyBudget!"
      END PROGRAM

    ELSE
      DISPLAY "Invalid choice. Please try again."
    END IF
  UNTIL user chooses to EXIT
END
